  "Older child (9–12): more detail": { es: "Niño mayor (9–12): más detalle", ar: "طفل أكبر (9–12): تفاصيل أكثر", zh: "大一点的孩子（9–12 岁）：更多细节", sw: "Mtoto mkubwa (9–12): maelezo zaidi", sv: "Äldre barn (9–12): mer detaljer", de: "Älteres Kind (9–12): mehr Details", pt: "Criança maior (9–12): mais detalhes", fr: "Enfant plus grand (9–12 ans) : plus de détails" },
